note: Which filters are tested in the same pass, and which keep their own.
let scores be a list of 72, 45 and 95.
to passing with score:
    give back score is at least 50.
to double with x:
    give back x times 2.
say how many scores that are above 50 there are.
say how many (the scores that are above 50) that are below 90 there are.
say how many scores that pass passing there are.
say how many scores where passing with it there are.
say any score is above double with 40.
say each score in scores plus 1.
say scores sorted, the scores where it is above 60.
say scores combined using (a function taking x and y that gives back x plus y).
say scores sorted by (a function taking x that gives back 0 minus x).
